@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
title Native picker - multiple material selection
actor Teacher
participant "Native form / picker" as Form
participant "Embedded browser" as Browser
participant "Local scope / catalog" as Scope
participant "Repository transfer" as Transfer
database "Native draft / provenance" as Files
Teacher -> Form : Open existing or new activity
Form -> Scope : Bind actual field, draft, context and limits
Teacher -> Form : Add files; select configured repository
Form -> Browser : Embed scoped HTML chooser
Teacher -> Browser : Filter / browse / select all or check materials
Browser -> Scope : Authenticated Fragment request
Scope -> Files : Exclude existing actor draft bytes before pagination
Scope --> Browser : Authorized results; canonical checks / grouped folder counts
opt Expand collapsed tree folder
 Teacher -> Browser : Open folder / child folder
 Browser -> Scope : Authenticated browser_tree Fragment under issued root
 Scope --> Browser : Bounded subfolder / file page; retain main cursor
end
note right of Browser : Filters retain focus and width.\nCheckboxes patch existing cards.\nFolder / cursor / scroll remain.
Teacher -> Browser : Review selection
Browser -> Scope : Expand and recheck selected sources
Scope --> Browser : Resulting tree / readable filenames / approval
Teacher -> Browser : Pencil opens native rename modal; remove files
Browser -> Scope : Rebuild reviewed digest
note over Teacher, Browser : Removal checks alone retain import approval.
Teacher -> Browser : Import materials
Browser -> Transfer : Documented native chooser callback
Transfer -> Scope : Revalidate digest and destination
Scope -> Files : Transactional copies / original declarations
Transfer --> Form : Native response / owning draft refresh
alt Save
 Teacher -> Form : Native Save
 Form -> Files : Core permanent activity save
else Cancel
 Teacher -> Form : Native Cancel
 note over Form, Files : Previously saved activity is unchanged
end
@enduml
